{"id":51599,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trilhos-do-endovelico\/"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:40:25","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:40:25","slug":"trilhos-do-endovelico","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trilhos-do-endovelico\/","title":{"rendered":"Trilhos do Endov\u00e9lico 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trilhos do Endov\u00e9lico 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os <strong>Trilhos do Endov\u00e9lico 2026<\/strong> levam os atletas a explorar a m\u00edstica paisagem alentejana, os montados de sobro e azinho e as margens do Rio Lucefecit na hist\u00f3rica vila de <strong>Terena<\/strong>, no concelho do <strong>Alandroal<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>\u00c9vora<\/strong>). Inspirada no deus da mitologia pr\u00e9-romana adorado no Santu\u00e1rio de Rocha da Mina, a prova combina single tracks t\u00e9cnicos com passagens por monumentos medievais.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e chegada junto ao altivo <strong>Castelo de Terena<\/strong>, o evento apresenta as vertentes de <strong>Trail Longo (30 km)<\/strong>, <strong>Trail Sprint (20 km)<\/strong>, <strong>Mini Trail (12 km)<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada (10 km)<\/strong>. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Alandroal United<\/strong> e do Munic\u00edpio proporciona almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio tradicional alentejano, anima\u00e7\u00e3o musical, cronometragem Trilho Perdido e trof\u00e9us em artesanato local.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">29 de Novembro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: bor